WEBVTT

00:01:59.407 --> 00:02:02.577
just to know who had already done
everything they needed to do

00:02:02.577 --> 00:02:04.287
to be released.

00:02:05.663 --> 00:02:08.291
So you can see how people
fall through the cracks.

00:02:09.167 --> 00:02:11.794
And it's hundreds of thousands of people.

00:02:13.254 --> 00:02:14.714
Nobody likes this.

00:02:14.755 --> 00:02:16.340
I have spent the last three years

00:02:16.382 --> 00:02:18.926
working with the people
who run state prison systems,

00:02:18.968 --> 00:02:21.762
and I can tell you
that nobody likes the fact

00:02:21.762 --> 00:02:23.472
that people are stuck in the system

00:02:23.514 --> 00:02:26.809
because databases
aren't talking to each other.

00:02:28.352 --> 00:02:31.147
It got like this because we have
a fragmented system